      <section id="about" class="about-area">
                  <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
               <h1 class="section-name" style="color: #2c5f2d">About Sheth Edmont Aurelia Project</h1>
               <div class="col-lg-7">
                  <div id="abt-text" class="abt-txt-area">
                     <p><strong>Sheth Edmont Kandivali West </strong>is a Project by<strong> Ashwin Sheth Group </strong>&amp; K Hemani situated in the most premium location of<strong> MG Road, Near Mahavir Nagar, </strong>Sai Nagar offers Opulent<strong> 2 &amp; 3 BHK</strong> Deck* Residences with the availability of <strong>Jodi Apartments</strong>. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities &amp; Specifications. Edmont Kandivali Project has 3 Towers and New Launch Edmont Aurelia is <strong>51 Storeys.</strong> Ashwin Sheth Kandivali Property Features 25+ Lifestyle <strong>Amenities </strong>like Multipurpose Hall, Security, Lounge Area, Indoor Games, Gym, Library, Gaming Arcade, Table Tennis, Party Lawn, Private Theatre. Sheth Edmont Aurelia<strong> </strong>has <strong>Excellent Connectivity</strong> • M.G Road - 300 m • S.V. Road - 850 m • Dahanukar Wadi Metro Station - 1.8 Km • New Link Road - 1.8 Km • Western Express Highway - 2.5 Km, HEALTH CARE • Namaha Hospital 1.1 Km • Lotus Hospital 3.7 Km, 🛍 RETAIL &amp; RECREATION • Raghuleela Mall 2.2 Km • Growels Mall 3.4 Km, EDUCATION • AVM SCHOOL 210 m • Billabong High International School 2.7 Km.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Edmont Aurelia </strong>by<strong> Ashwin Sheth Group </strong>is close to Solitaire Paradise, Grishma Heights, Orchid Residency, Dheeraj Residency, Surbhi Complex, Krishna Society, Vasant Vaibhv, Shreeji Apartment, Royal Samarpan, Surbhi Complex, Heritage Parody.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Kandivali</strong> is well<strong> </strong>Connected to Western Express Highway, Swami Vivekananda Road, Zenith Hospital, Phoeni Hospitals, Inorbit Mall Malad, Oberoi Mall, PVR Cinemas, Inox, Dmart, Country Club, EPFO Office, Kandivali Railway Station, Malad Railway Station, Borivali Railway Station, Domestic Airport, International Airport..</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Kandivali West </strong>has many Projects Konark Elegance, Jadeite Nandanvan, Shreeji Skyrise, Ruparel Optima, Parinee Essence, Ekta Terraces, 19 North, Siddha Seabrook, Supreme Willows, Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights, Shreeji Royal Samarpn, Ruparel Westsky, Rodium Xpoint, Orchid Suburbia.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Ashwin Sheth Group </strong>has many ongoing and completed projects Edmont, Avantè, Montana, Sheth Victoria, Sheth Cnergy, Sheth Zuri, Sheth Midori, 72 West, Sheth Vasant Lawns, Vivana Mall, Sheth Avalon, Sheth Fiona, Sheth Athena, Fortune Park LakeCity Hotel, Jupiter Hospital, Thane’s Platinum Belt.</p>                  </div>
                
